0..68 Comment "//! This source checks univalence across certified signature strata."
69..72 Comment "//!"
73..151 Comment "//! `ua[n, k]` derives a path between models\' degree telescopes through degree"
152..215 Comment "//! `n`. It uses shapes of size at most `k` when each vertex is"
216..237 Comment "//! a shared corolla."
238..241 Comment "//!"
242..320 Comment "//! The checker uses the Segal condition to certify stages from degree two. It"
321..397 Comment "//! names a refusal for an uncertified degree, bound, table or shape budget."
398..401 Comment "//!"
402..477 Comment "//! - cites: [Shulman-2015-univalence_inverse_diagrams_homotopy_canonicity]"
478..481 Comment "//!"
482..658 Comment "//! [Shulman-2015-univalence_inverse_diagrams_homotopy_canonicity]: https://doi.org/10.1017/S0960129514000565 \"Shulman, Univalence for Inverse Diagrams and Homotopy Canonicity\""
